# Files under public/ that must NOT be uploaded as browser-reachable assets.
#
# wrangler uploads everything in this directory (see [assets] in
# wrangler.toml) and does NOT read .gitignore, so editor and OS droppings
# that land here would otherwise be deployed and publicly served. Visual
# Studio in particular writes a .vs/ index folder next to whatever source
# tree is open — including inside public/ — and its .vsidx files are held
# open while VS is running, which fails the deploy outright with
# "EBUSY: resource busy or locked" rather than anything self-explanatory.
.vs/
**/.vs/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
